# Loaded only by `npm run dev:mock` (vite --mode mock): the SPA answers
# /api/* from the MSW mocks in src/client/mocks, for UI work without local
# secrets. Public values only: anything prefixed VITE_ ends up in the bundle.
# Plain `npm run dev`, every build and the e2e suite use the real Worker API.
VITE_USE_MOCKS=true
